lisa-design:
- T01 keeps argocd.yaml as its own PR workflow: the shared ci-helm can't run a kind cluster + Argo CD, so it is not part of ci / required (it never was a required check either).
- The old schema check (make helm.schema && make check-diff) became helm.schema.check, which generates into a temp dir and diffs, so `make helm.test.*` never rewrites the tree and doesn't fail on unrelated uncommitted work.
- helm.test.app/helm.test.agent fold in every check the old ci-app/ci-agent ran (unittest, schema drift, agent-bootstrap run.sh), so the make-targets input is exactly the two targets the plan names.
- Fixed ct yamllint findings in values.yaml (whitespace only) instead of adding a relaxed lintconf, so the repo stays on ct's defaults like the mock.
- Deleted charts/ccf-app/Chart.lock (postgresql 16.7.27) rather than regenerating it: Chart.yaml has `dependencies: []`, so the lock is orphaned and breaks `helm dependency build` in ct lint.
- release-agent.yaml/release-app.yaml only get $GITHUB_OUTPUT quoted (actionlint/shellcheck); they keep publishing until T03 replaces them.
